id: ops-release-1118-merge-heading
title: Reconcile the v2026.11.18 heading in the PR merge commit
description: Round CP head 204cfdd passes its clean checkout gates. The GitHub-generated merge commit for pm-ops PR 295 combines the upstream v2026.11.18 changelog heading with the branch regeneration.
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 1
tags[2]: "area:release",follow-up
created_at: "2026-11-18T19:47:51.951Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-18T19:47:55.604Z"
author: codex-sol
repro_steps: Compare CHANGELOG.md at PR head 204cfdd and refs/pull/295/merge. Check the Node 22 and Node 26 jobs for the merge checkout.
expected_result: The integrated changelog has exactly one v2026.11.18 heading and passes the changelog and release-section gates.
actual_result: The PR head has one heading and the generated merge commit has two. Both Node jobs reject the merged changelog.
